# Audit log of every LLM call (system+user prompts). Grows ~5MB/day.
# Exceeds GitHub 100MB hard file size limit (was 113MB on 2026-05-19).
# Preserved locally on the server at audit/_global.jsonl for forensics.
audit/_global.jsonl
